      "blurb": "A quiet neutral panel that is PROUD of the surface, with a visible fabricated rim. Its whole point is RESTRAINT — the plate says nothing so the one active control can. THE VIBRON MATERIAL (operator-ruled 2026-08-05): brutalist massive plate hard-cast IS Vibron.",
