      "id": "lit-cast",
      "label": "Lit cast",
      "blurb": "A hard offset shadow AND a painted lit-from-behind pop. The neubrutalist move: it makes a saturated surface read as lit from directly behind. Never on a quiet material — the halo is what LOUD looks like.",
      "shadows": [
        {
          "offset": [
            3,
            3
